Fcell-ontology)\n\nAppearance settings\n\nResetting focus\n\nYou signed in with another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You signed out in another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You switched accounts on another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. Dismiss alert\n\n[obophenotype](/obophenotype) / **[cell-ontology](/obophenotype/cell-ontology)** Public\n\n-   [Notifications](/login?return_to=%2Fobophenotype%2Fcell-ontology) You must be signed in to change notification settings\n-   [Fork 61](/login?return_to=%2Fobophenotype%2Fcell-ontology)\n-   [Star 197](/login?return_to=%2Fobophenotype%2Fcell-ontology)\n    \n\n-   [Code](/obophenotype/cell-ontology)\n-   [Issues 302](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues)\n-   [Pull requests 30](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/pulls)\n-   [Discussions](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/discussions)\n-   [Actions](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/actions)\n-   [Projects](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/projects)\n-   [Security and quality 0](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/security)\n-   [Insights](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/pulse)\n\nAdditional navigation options\n\n-   [Code](/obophenotype/cell-ontology)\n-   [Issues](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues)\n-   [Pull requests](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/pulls)\n-   [Discussions](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/discussions)\n-   [Actions](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/actions)\n-   [Projects](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/projects)\n-   [Security and quality](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/security)\n-   [Insights](/obophenotype/cell-ontology/pulse)\n\n# Add more detail + markers for LGE and CGE derived interneurons #3091\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nOpen\n\nOpen\n\n[Add more detail + markers for LGE and CGE derived interneurons](#top)#3091\n\nCopy link\n\nAssignees\n\n[![RiveraAndrea83](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205639972?s=64&v=4)](/RiveraAndrea83)\n\nLabels\n\n[BICAN](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22BICAN%22)[Mouse Brain](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Mouse%20Brain%22)[Priority-High](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Priority-High%22)[Stale](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Stale%22)\n\nMilestone\n\n[\n\nMilestone 08/12/25\n\n](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/milestone/26)\n\n[![@dosumis](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112839?v=4&size=80)](https://github.com/dosumis)\n\n## Description\n\n[![@dosumis](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112839?v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/dosumis)\n\n[dosumis](https://github.com/dosumis)\n\nopened [on Apr 29, 2025](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3091#issue-3028391414)\n\nIssue body actions\n\nNeurons in single cell data from brain are commonly claimed to be CGE or LGE derived. We have classes for these already, but it would be good to have some record of common markers used + some testing against datasets. Descriptions could also be fleshed out a bit.\n\nSee [https://www.perplexity.ai/search/what-markers-indicate-origin-o-AjKUvjMqQVOBOKMZm9hoRg](https://www.perplexity.ai/search/what-markers-indicate-origin-o-AjKUvjMqQVOBOKMZm9hoRg)\n\nReactions are currently unavailable\n\n## Metadata\n\n## Metadata\n\n### Assignees\n\n-   [![@RiveraAndrea83](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205639972?s=64&v=4)\n    \n    RiveraAndrea83\n    \n    ](/RiveraAndrea83)\n\n### Labels\n\n[BICAN](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22BICAN%22)[Mouse Brain](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Mouse%20Brain%22)[Priority-High](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Priority-High%22)[Stale](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Stale%22)\n\n### Type\n\nNo type\n\n### Projects\n\n[\n\nCL\\_wtgc\\_ticket\\_tracker\n\n](https://github.com/orgs/obophenotype/projects/23)\n\nStatus\n\nIn Progress\n\nShow more project fields\n\n### Milestone\n\n-   [\n    \n    Milestone 08/12/25\n    \n    ](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/milestone/26)\n\n### Relationships\n\nNone yet\n\n### Development\n\nNo branches or pull requests\n\n## Issue actions\n\n## Footer\n\n[](https://github.com)© 2026 GitHub, Inc.\n\n### Footer navigation\n\n-   [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\n-   [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\n-   [Security](https://github.com/security)\n-   [Status](https://www.githubstatus.com/)\n-   [Community](https://github.community/)\n-   [Docs](https://docs.github.com/)\n-   [Contact](https://support.github.com?tags=dotcom-footer)\n-   Manage cookies\n-   Do not share my personal information\n\nYou can’t perform that action at this time.","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3091 (text/html; charset=utf-8)","time":{"start":1778555661983,"end":1778555662946}},"id":"prt_e1a2d9b51001xYgVY7D6UZfrcU","sessionID":"ses_1e5eb4698ffeDZfj1eKMY5ZB3H","messageID":"msg_e1a2bb05e001e3PYZPdDfGgFXJ"}}
